 R←Test_31(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;folder;file
⍝ When collecting the crash information fails, `Process` must still do its final duty (here: `signal`).
⍝ The error folder is made impossible to create by putting it "below" a file.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

⍝ Preconditions...
 folder←GetTempPath⊃⎕SI
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir folder
 {}'CREATE!'FilesAndDirs.CheckPath folder
 file←folder,'/AFile.txt'
 (⊂'Not a folder')⎕NPUT file
 parms←##.HandleError.CreateParms
 parms.errorFolder←file,'/Errors'
 parms.killThreads←0
 parms.signal←501

 :Trap 501
     ##.HandleError.Process parms
     →T.GoToTidyUp 1
 :EndTrap

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}FilesAndDirs.RmDir folder
